WEBVTT

00:01:56.501 --> 00:02:01.715
So… who founded what,
and what’s the name of the secret house?

00:02:01.715 --> 00:02:06.086
Pause the video now to
figure it out for yourself!

00:02:06.086 --> 00:02:07.110
Answer in 3

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:08.411
Answer in 2

00:02:08.411 --> 00:02:09.265
Answer in 1

00:02:09.265 --> 00:02:13.871
The hardest part of solving this logic
puzzle is knowing where to start.

00:02:13.871 --> 00:02:19.105
No rule by itself is enough to assign 
a founder to his or her house,

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:20.605
so the next best thing

00:02:20.605 --> 00:02:24.105
would be to combine a pair of rules
to learn something.

00:02:24.105 --> 00:02:27.925
4 and 5 are good candidates 
to try that with,

00:02:27.925 --> 00:02:33.108
because they contain a lot of constraints
and both mention Longmous.